<%#
# «Реквизиты» of an organization

A key/value block of the side column: legal name, BIN, address, phone and the e-mail for billing documents. A value
that is not filled in shows a dash. In a narrow column the key stands over its value (`admin-kv--stackable`), so an
e-mail is not broken in the middle of a word.

## Local variables:

- `organization`: the Organization.
%>
<%
  rows = [
    [t('super_admin.organizations.card.requisites.legal_name'), organization.legal_name],
    [t('super_admin.organizations.card.requisites.bin'), organization.bin],
    [t('super_admin.organizations.card.requisites.address'), organization.address],
    [t('super_admin.organizations.card.requisites.phone'), organization.phone],
    [t('super_admin.organizations.card.requisites.billing_email'), organization.billing_email]
  ]
%>

<section class="admin-block" aria-labelledby="requisites-title" data-testid="requisites-block">
  <h2 class="admin-block__title" id="requisites-title"><%= t('super_admin.organizations.card.requisites.title') %></h2>
  <dl class="admin-kv admin-kv--stackable">
    <% rows.each do |key, value| %>
      <div class="admin-kv__row">
        <dt class="admin-kv__key"><%= key %></dt>
        <dd class="admin-kv__value"><%= value.presence || '—' %></dd>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </dl>
</section>
